# The Slack payload distinguishes a recovery from an alarm and carries the
# suppressed count. Ignore the kind and the all-clear wears the rotating light.
file: rust/banshee-api/src/slack.rs
test: the_payload_distinguishes_recovery_and_carries_the_suppressed_count
---OLD---
        NotificationKind::Recovered => (":white_check_mark:", "recovered"),
---NEW---
        NotificationKind::Recovered => (":rotating_light:", "critical"),
